re.findall()
re.sub()
re.split()

Common Real-World Regex Examples
Use Case	        Pattern
Email	            ^[\w\.-]+@[\w\.-]+\.\w+$
Phone	            ^[6-9]\d{9}$
PIN Code	        ^\d{6}$
Username	        ^[a-zA-Z0-9_]{4,15}$
URL	                https?://\S+

Important Regex Symbols
Symbol	        Meaning
.	            Any character
^	            Start of string
$	            End of string
*	            0 or more
+	            1 or more
?	            0 or 1
{}	            Exact repetitions
[]	            Character set
|	            OR
()	            Grouping

Special Character Classes
Pattern	        Meaning
\d	            Digit
\D	            Non-digit
\w	            Word character
\W	            Non-word character
\s	            Whitespace
\S	            Non-whitespace